{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56309","headline":"剑歌 一 · 李斌","name":"剑歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有一长剑，磨来十数年。\n但藏玉匣里，未向代人传。\n锷露星将转，珠开月共悬。\n霜锋暎牛斗，雪刃倚长天。\n每欲清万国，常怀定四边。\n希君持取用，方谓识龙泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56309.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56309","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}